---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Photo Credits — Motiva Hub" description="Attributions for the photography used across the Motiva Hub journal.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">Attribution</p>
      <h1>Photo <em>Credits.</em></h1>
      <p>
        The photographs in our journal come from open-license collections (CC-BY, CC0, PDM)
        discovered via Openverse. Each image is color-graded into the unified Motiva Hub
        cinematic style. We thank the photographers below.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feed">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Public Domain (CC0 / PDM)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><code>secure-self.jpg</code> — “stocks-1709” by Artem Beliaikin (CC0)</li>
        <li><code>identity-precedes-outcome.jpg</code> — bust portrait by Thad Zajdowicz (CC0)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top:2rem;">Creative Commons — Attribution (CC-BY)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><code>athlete-discipline.jpg</code> — by Roy Harryman</li>
        <li><code>attention-as-asset.jpg</code> — “Beam of light through the smoke” by Brett Levin Photography</li>
        <li><code>atomic-habits-review.jpg</code> — “Pebble Art” by pshutterbug</li>
        <li><code>beginner-again.jpg</code> — by mypubliclands / Bureau of Land Management</li>
        <li><code>body-votes-first.jpg</code> — “Indoor Track and Field” by Steven Pisano</li>
        <li><code>cant-hurt-me-review.jpg</code> — “Los Mellizos” by Carlos Varela</li>
        <li><code>comparison-trap.jpg</code> — “Hiking to Sněžka: The Top” by *rboed*</li>
        <li><code>community-discipline.jpg</code> — “Beach volleyball net at sunset” by photoloni</li>
        <li><code>deep-work-ritual.jpg</code> — “Writing Writer” by Negative Space</li>
        <li><code>fuel-before-willpower.jpg</code> — “Delicious Berries” by geishaboy500</li>
        <li><code>long-ascent.jpg</code> — “Morning View” by BLM Oregon &amp; Washington</li>
        <li><code>play-on-purpose.jpg</code> — “My Saturday” by AMagill</li>
        <li><code>proof-over-noise.jpg</code> — by trophygeek</li>
        <li><code>psychology-of-money-business.jpg</code> — “Metropolis” by dolbinator1000</li>
