      </ul>

      <p style="margin-top:2rem;color:var(--muted);">
        Full source links are maintained in the project’s <code>PHOTO-CREDITS.md</code>.
        Found an attribution error? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> and we will fix it promptly.
      </p>
    </div>
